  {
    "hotel_id": "186314",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/oria-hotel-jakarta/hotel/jakarta-id.html",
    "name": "Oria Hotel Jakarta",
    "detail": "The hotel is located in central Jakarta, very near to the the major shopping centers, the city's main roundabout (with its Welcome to Jakarta statue and water fountain), and plenty of restaurants ranging from very cheap to very expensive. It is also near the central business district and many embassies (Japan, Germany, etc.). 24-hr McDonalds and Startbucks are within 5 minutes walk. The nearby Jalan Sabang offers plenty of local food at very very cheap prices, and Jalan Jaksa offers restaurants and pubs with cheep beers. A beautiful catholic church is also nearby. The hotel offers simple accommodation. Rooms are larger than the nearby Ibis hotels, and much better designed than budget hotels. The room we stayed was very clean, has large bathroom (shower only), comfortable bed, TV and safety deposit box. View from the room was windows of another building just a few meters away. There were no gym and pool at the time we stayed. The breakfast costed IDR 100,000 (around USD 9.-) per person but where limited choice, so we opted to have breakfast at nearby Jalan Jaksa at half the price. There is free parking. Staffs were attentive, polite and helpful.",
